    intro: "Vedic astrology recognises nine planets (Navagraha): the Sun, Moon, Mars, Mercury, Jupiter, Venus, Saturn, and the two lunar nodes Rahu and Ketu. Each planet governs certain themes, rules certain signs, and runs a planetary period (Mahadasha) of a fixed length. This guide introduces each one in plain language.",
